## Context
Single best model, vary: temperature (0.0/0.7), prompt language (EN/FR),
output format (text/CSV/JSON), few-shot (0/3). ~24 runs. Budget ~$5-10.

## Key question
How much do secondary variables matter compared to model choice and
information regime?

## Exit criteria
- 24 runs completed and scored
- Comparison table showing effect sizes of each variable
